     "body": "<p>Discussed on the 9 Nov committer call; there are some concerns about the way chained disseminations are to be dealt with, the conceptual model of datastreams vs disseminations, etc.  Want to defer action until we can follow up with reporter.</p>",
     "created": "09/Nov/10 7:17 PM",
     "id": "11662",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10772/comment/11662",
