    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Agreed, the focus of this is not overall to propose how chaining of disseminators should be done.  (Though in the absence of this in the short term, it does provide a mechanism)</p>\n\n<p>The motivation for doing this could be expressed more simply as:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>the current code allows parameters passed to methods to be passed to the underlying bound datastream where the datastream is of type \"E\"</li>\n\t<li>however only URL query parameters are currently passed, in a REST-ful world this should be expanded to also include path parameters</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Though it could be argued that the mechanism currently in place should not be there at all and should be removed?  But should we be removing functionality that people may already being made use of?</p>",
     "created": "10/Nov/10 11:16 AM",
     "id": "11669",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10772/comment/11669",
     "updateAuthor": {
